Senator Joel Villanueva: But I never really put myself into a position na talagang andun lang ako.

327
01:07:33,500 --> 01:07:35,020
Senator Joel Villanueva: I'm always at the outside.

328
01:07:35,660 --> 01:07:39,640
Senator Joel Villanueva: Kasi like in UST, just to share with you, sa UST for example,

