2928
02:30:00,000 --> 02:30:07,700
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: Third floor na po kami kung di po ako nagkakamali. Hanggang seven floors lang naman po yan. Kailangan lang po namin tapusin kasi nagawa na.

2929
02:30:07,700 --> 02:30:16,800
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: Ito po yung Cebu Regional Training Center, Chairman JV. Ito po yung usapan natin last month kung paano.

2930
02:30:17,280 --> 02:30:28,100
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: Nagbigay po ang Cebu City ng 1,000 square meters para itaguyod yung Arnis Gymnastics and Danceport Facility.

2931
02:30:28,100 --> 02:30:56,400
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: Tutulong rin po si Senator Mig Zubiri para maitayo po ito. Sinabi niya, "Tutulungan ko kayong pondohan iyan." Ito yung track and field oval po sa PhilSports na hindi na na-renovate since the late 80s, na kailangan po talaga nating pagandahin para magamit sa international competitions. Ito po yung UP Mindanao Aquatic Center na nakabinbin na tinatapos na rin po natin.

2932
02:30:57,240 --> 02:30:58,080
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: Yan po.

2933
02:30:58,100 --> 02:31:03,440
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: Ito po. Ongoing po yan. Kailangan na rin po ng pondo para tapusin.

2934
02:31:03,640 --> 02:31:13,440
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: Ito po, Senator JV, Chairman, yung sinabi niyo sa akin na facility sa Cebu na nakakalungkot kasi in three years time ganyan na po siya.

2935
02:31:13,900 --> 02:31:19,120
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: Meron na po kaming initial budget na pinagawa ni Commissioner Ed Heiko.

2936
02:31:19,860 --> 02:31:23,640
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: Papunta po ako sa Cebu sa October 16 para personal na inspect.

2937
02:31:24,700 --> 02:31:28,080
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: Sabi ko nga po, sana matulungan mo kami rito.

2938
02:31:28,100 --> 02:31:33,060
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: So, Center, kasi kaya na po natin paspasan ito para matapos po.

2939
02:31:33,160 --> 02:31:39,980
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: Kapareho po ito nung ginawa namin sa Baguio na nagumastos po kami sa Baguio ng mga 40 million, Center JV.

2940
02:31:40,580 --> 02:31:48,980
PSC Chairman John Patrick C. Gregorio: Ito po yung sa Rizal na talagang kailangan na rin i-rehabilitate yung swimming pool stadium sa Rizal kasi po maganda na po yung Rizal.

