Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: lahat

4393
03:30:00,000 --> 03:30:05,120
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Lahat ng sports, kita mo sa golf, kailangan nakatuto ka talaga, wala kang dapat isipin.

4394
03:30:05,120 --> 03:30:16,420
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Even sa basketball, maglalaro ka, even sa bowling, mag-target mo, alam ni Anti-Commissioner Bongko yan, na focus talaga itong sports parati.

4395
03:30:16,580 --> 03:30:24,000
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: So ibig sabihin, dapat po ay supportado ang ating mga athletes sa kanilang mga pangailangan, equipments, pagkain, allowances,

4396
03:30:24,000 --> 03:30:28,780
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: and of course, moral support ibigay natin sa kanila.

4397
03:30:29,760 --> 03:30:34,620
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Sabi ko, malaking karangalan po ang daladala nila para sa ating parati tuwing nananalo sila.

4398
03:30:35,260 --> 03:30:44,060
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Hindi po matutumbasan and we should be proud of it sa kanilang pagko-compete parati at daladala nila yung ating bandila.

4399
03:30:44,600 --> 03:30:48,900
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: So salamat po sa inyong lahat. I'm so happy na nandito po kayo.

4400
03:30:48,900 --> 03:30:53,900
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: I would also like to reiterate my full support for this agency.

4401
03:30:54,000 --> 03:30:56,000
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: I would also like to thank the agencies and their respective mandates.

4402
03:30:56,620 --> 03:31:03,200
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Ito pong Gaban PSC. Both agencies play important and complementary roles in strengthening Philippine sports.

4403
03:31:03,740 --> 03:31:12,880
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Magkaiba man po ang kanilang mandato, isa pong layunin ang mapalakas ang Philippine sports at mapangalagaan ang kapakanan po ng bawat atletang Pilipino.

4404
03:31:12,880 --> 03:31:18,320
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: We have seen the remarkable achievements of our Filipino athletes in various international competitions,

4405
03:31:18,900 --> 03:31:23,880
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: including the recently concluded 2026 Asian Games po sa Nagoya.

4406
03:31:24,000 --> 03:31:26,200
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Ako mismo ay pumunta po doon.

4407
03:31:26,740 --> 03:31:31,000
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Hindi po sapat na purihin lang natin sila kapag nananalo at nag-uwi ng medalya.

4408
03:31:31,420 --> 03:31:42,280
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: We must ensure that they receive adequate and sustained support from grassroots development to international competitions and even throughout their professional careers.

4409
03:31:42,940 --> 03:31:52,660
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: We are prepared to support additional funding for programs that will directly benefit our athletes and strengthen sports development nationwide.

4410
03:31:52,660 --> 03:31:53,660
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Patuloy po natin ipaglalaman.

4411
03:31:54,000 --> 03:31:56,840
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Ang kapakanan ng ating mga atleta.

4412
03:31:57,520 --> 03:32:03,460
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Again, I just ask the PSC and Gab to utilize your budgets prudently.

4413
03:32:03,680 --> 03:32:07,240
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Gamitin lang po ito sa tama at huwag itong masayang.

4414
03:32:07,740 --> 03:32:13,060
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Make sure na mapunta talaga ito sa ating mga atleta at sa pagpapalakas ng sports dito sa ating bansa.

4415
03:32:13,680 --> 03:32:21,580
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: With that, the budgets of the Philippine Sports Commission and the Games and Amusement Board are hereby submitted to plenary,

4416
03:32:21,580 --> 03:32:23,580
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: taking into consideration the discussions.

4417
03:32:24,000 --> 03:32:25,080
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Discussions today.

4418
03:32:25,640 --> 03:32:28,140
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: This hearing is hereby suspended.

4419
03:32:28,580 --> 03:32:30,580
Senator Christopher Lawrence T. Go: Salamat po and congratulations sa inyo.

4420
03:32:30,740 --> 03:32:32,080
